# Notes kept on disk for reference only — not tracked, not pushed. Nothing
# tracked is allowed to depend on one of these: a reader who clones this repo
# will not have them, so anything they say that matters belongs in the file
# that needs it (phase2/validate.py enforces this for IAM-table.md).
# Listing a file that is already tracked does nothing — git only ignores what
# it is not already following — so every name below is untracked, and adding
# one here is not a way to un-push something.
# Tracked on purpose: README.md, .github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md (GitHub has
# to serve it on every PR), .github/dependabot.yml, Eval-Suite/EVAL_PLAN.md
# (tracked since before this list existed), and phase2/IAM-table.md — the
# Lead's runbook, which phase2 no longer pushes anywhere (see phase2/lib.sh's
# PHASE2_FILE_MAP).
docs/
phase2/jobs/EXAMPLE-knowledge-store-sessions.md
phase2/jobs/README.md
tests/README.md
tests/outcomes/*.md
